{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 26, :comments ["<b>For Heshbon was the city of Sihon.</b> Since after it is written: ״וישב ישראל בארץ האמורי״, it says here: do not be surprised that we say that Heshbon was of the land of the Amorites, when we know that it was of the land of Moab — for Heshbon is now the city of Sihon, for he fought against the first king of Moab and conquered it from his hand — not against Balak king of Moab, but against the first king who preceded Balak."], :book :numbers, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:09:48.679243036Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}